/*
 * Defines the token set used by the macro tokenizer.
 *
 * MacroPatternTokens enumerates all tokens that the macro lexer must
 * recognize when scanning macro-generated content. These include:
 *
 *   - macro-specific opening delimiters(`#{`, `#[`, `#(`),
 *   - standard structural delimiters(`{`, `[`, `(`, `}`, `]`, `)`),
 *   - punctuation used in macro patterns(`::`, `$`, `-`),
 *   - whitespace and skip tokens(space, return, tab).
 *
 * <hr>
 *
